(# Beginner Guide: BonChat Code Auto-Paste to 5 Accounts \(Android\)) Tj
0 -14 Td () Tj
0 -14 Td (## 1\) Goal) Tj
0 -14 Td (This setup lets your spare Android phone do the following:) Tj
0 -14 Td (- Listen for code messages from BonChat.) Tj
0 -14 Td (- Accept only valid 9-character alphanumeric codes.) Tj
0 -14 Td (- Work only during two time windows:) Tj
0 -14 Td (  - 11:55 AM to 12:15 PM) Tj
0 -14 Td (  - 5:55 PM to 6:15 PM) Tj
0 -14 Td (- Open each account URL, go to Futures -> Invited me, paste code, and press Confirm.) Tj
0 -14 Td (- Close browser tabs after each account to reduce memory use.) Tj
0 -14 Td (- Optionally wake phone at start and lock phone at end.) Tj
0 -14 Td () Tj
0 -14 Td (## 2\) Requirements) Tj
0 -14 Td (- Android phone \(your old Redmi is fine\).) Tj
0 -14 Td (- Charger connected and internet always ON.) Tj
0 -14 Td (- Apps:) Tj
0 -14 Td (  1. Tasker) Tj
0 -14 Td (  2. AutoNotification) Tj
0 -14 Td (  3. AutoInput) Tj
0 -14 Td (  4. Chrome \(or Kiwi Browser\)) Tj
0 -14 Td () Tj
0 -14 Td (## 3\) Phone settings \(must do\)) Tj
0 -14 Td (For Tasker, AutoNotification, AutoInput, and Chrome:) Tj
0 -14 Td (- Disable battery optimization.) Tj
0 -14 Td (- Enable Auto-start / background run.) Tj
0 -14 Td (- Allow notification access \(AutoNotification\).) Tj
0 -14 Td (- Allow accessibility service \(AutoInput\).) Tj
0 -14 Td () Tj
0 -14 Td (These settings are required, otherwise automation may stop in background.) Tj
0 -14 Td () Tj
