0 -14 Td (- URL3) Tj
0 -14 Td (- URL4) Tj
0 -14 Td (- URL5) Tj
0 -14 Td () Tj
0 -14 Td (Each URL should open with login already saved.) Tj
0 -14 Td () Tj
0 -14 Td (## 5\) Tasker variables) Tj
0 -14 Td (Create these global variables:) Tj
0 -14 Td (- %listen = 0   \(window OFF by default\)) Tj
0 -14 Td (- %latest_code = \(empty\)) Tj
0 -14 Td (- %code_count = 0) Tj
0 -14 Td (- %target_url = \(used when submitting each account\)) Tj
