0 -14 Td (## 7\) Task: GET_CODE_FROM_BONCHAT) Tj
0 -14 Td (Use this task with AutoNotification Intercept.) Tj
0 -14 Td () Tj
0 -14 Td (Actions:) Tj
0 -14 Td (1. If %listen != 1 -> Stop) Tj
0 -14 Td (2. Set %msg = %antext) Tj
0 -14 Td (3. Regex extract: \([A-Za-z0-9]{9}\) from %msg, store match in %m1) Tj
0 -14 Td (4. If %m1 is not valid -> Stop) Tj
0 -14 Td (5. Set %latest_code = %m1) Tj
0 -14 Td (6. Add 1 to %code_count) Tj
0 -14 Td (7. Notify captured code and count) Tj
0 -14 Td () Tj
0 -14 Td (This keeps the latest valid code when multiple messages arrive.) Tj
0 -14 Td () Tj
